  name: 'generic_2d_showcase_ui_script_live_authoring_proof',
  description: 'Controlled proof harness for Generic2DShowcase retained UI/script live authoring. Defaults to read-only/blocked evidence; only action:"prove" with explicit allowLiveProof and confirmRetainedUiScriptMutation can attempt script create/import, UI prefab create, script bind, static validation, and console proof in a live Cocos Editor context.',
